name walk-fungus1-31-bench-to-hornet
title from the bench save in Fungus1_31 that walk-new-game-to-hornet makes (fungus1-31-bench.mcd, the card that run wrote, no cheat): the climb, Fungus1_32, Fungus1_20_v02 and Fungus1_21 to Hornet, Hornet beaten fairly, the Cloak and the dash. The back half of walk-new-game-to-hornet, the same boot and the same steps
max_ticks 160000
sync poll
# fungus1-31-bench.mcd is the card of a walk-new-game-to-hornet run at its power cycle (the gate's report/walk-new-game-to-hornet/cards/), taken
# right after the bench save. A change to the save format or to the run before the bench needs a fresh copy; the card's own checks say so.
card fungus1-31-bench.mcd
include continue-title.walk
include fungus1-31-bench-to-hornet.walk
